---
layout: layout.njk
pagination:
  data: site.interviews
  size: 1
  alias: interview
permalink: '{{ interview.page }}'
eleventyComputed:
  title: '{{ interview.title }}'
  description: '{{ interview.summary }}'
---
{#- An interview (content/interviews/<id>.md): what was done to the transcript, the questions as a list, the things
    it is about, then the transcript itself. Every question has the address #qN and a # link to copy it, and the
    questions that are about particular things show them as tags (anchorQuestions in collection/site.ts). The
    transcript is Jamie's words and keeps its emphasis, like a thing's story. #}
<article class="interview">
  <header class="intro">
    <p class="crumbs"><a href="/interviews/">Interviews</a></p>
    <h1>{{ interview.title }}</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ interview.summary }}</p>
    <p class="story-span muted">Recorded {{ interview.started | date }}{% if interview.ended != interview.started %} to {{ interview.ended | date }}{% endif %} · {{ interview.index | length }} questions · {{ interview.cast | length }} things</p>
  </header>
  <section class="interview-notes" id="notes" aria-labelledby="about-this-transcript">
    <h2 id="about-this-transcript">About this transcript</h2>
    <p>Thingy asked the questions and Jamie answered them out loud. What follows is the transcript, as he spoke it. Where the site quotes him, it quotes this.</p>
    <ul>
      {% for note in interview.notes %}<li>{{ note }}</li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>
  <section class="interview-index" id="questions" aria-labelledby="the-questions">
    <h2 id="the-questions">The questions</h2>
    <ol class="question-index">
      {% for q in interview.index %}<li value="{{ q.n }}"><a href="#q{{ q.n }}">{{ q.text }}</a></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </section>
  <section class="interview-cast" id="things" aria-labelledby="things-he-talks-about">
    <h2 id="things-he-talks-about">Things he talks about</h2>
    <p>{% for thing in interview.cast %}<a class="tag" href="{{ thing.page }}">{{ thing.title }}</a> {% endfor %}</p>
  </section>
  <section class="story interview-body" id="transcript">
    {{ interview | interviewHtml | safe }}
  </section>
  <footer class="thing-footer">
    <p class="muted"><a href="/interviews/">All interviews</a> · <a href="{{ site.repository }}/blob/main/content/interviews/{{ interview.id }}.md">The transcript file</a></p>
  </footer>
</article>
